msgid "A combinational circuit is built by connecting NOT, AND, OR, and XOR gates according to the Boolean expression structure."
msgstr "A combinational circuit is built by connecting NOT, AND, OR, and XOR gates according to the Boolean expression structure."

msgid "A greedy algorithm makes the best local choice at each step. It works when local optimal choices lead to a globally optimal solution."
msgstr "A greedy algorithm makes the best local choice at each step. It works when local optimal choices lead to a globally optimal solution."

msgid "A truth table lists every input combination and the corresponding output. For n variables, it contains 2^n rows."
msgstr "A truth table lists every input combination and the corresponding output. For n variables, it contains 2^n rows."

