msgstr "Big O gives an asymptotic upper bound, Big Θ a tight bound, and Big Ω a lower bound."

msgid "Boolean algebra works with the values 0 and 1 and is a foundation of digital logic."
msgstr "Boolean algebra works with the values 0 and 1 and is a foundation of digital logic."

msgid "Boolean simplification reduces an expression without changing its logical function, often reducing the number of gates."
msgstr "Boolean simplification reduces an expression without changing its logical function, often reducing the number of gates."

msgid "Chatbot lokal me Ollama për logjikë dixhitale, matematikë diskrete, analizë algoritmesh dhe imazhe qarqesh. Përgjigjet ndjekin gjuhën e zgjedhur."
